  "invariants": [
    "No report or no cooperative transmission is not an empty-airspace claim.",
    "Cooperative and non-cooperative traffic coverage are separate classes and metrics.",
    "ADS-B-only claims cannot qualify non-cooperative traffic coverage.",
    "Every coverage claim binds a class, volume, time, environment, profile, source and evidence type.",
    "Coverage, detection, track initiation, track continuity, classification and physical occupancy are separate claims.",
    "Multiple receiver IDs sharing a critical failure domain count as one independent family.",
    "Unknown dependency inventory is not independence.",
    "Time/PNT loss invalidates the affected time-dependent track claim, not the physical aircraft.",
    "A sensor outside its environment envelope cannot qualify coverage for that cell.",
    "Qualified coverage is not proof of zero traffic or a clearance to treat all untracked space as free.",
    "Unresolved or not-qualified surveillance returns possible occupancy or not-assessable, never an empty occupancy set.",
    "The adapter performs no DAA avoidance, tactical instruction, flight control or operational authorization.",
    "A no-report observation remains unresolved even when the cell has a qualified coverage claim; coverage is not proof of zero traffic.",
    "An explicitly degraded upstream sensor/service claim does not count toward fully qualified independent coverage."
  ],
  "required_mutations": [
    "Remove one cooperative ADS-B report while preserving the cell; no empty-space claim may be created.",
    "Change an ADS-B claim's traffic class from cooperative-crewed to non-cooperative-crewed without new evidence; coverage must fail.",
    "Widen the sensor coverage time interval only by changing its validity, then remove the current tick from that interval; coverage must cease.",
    "Change a dependency inventory from complete to unknown; independent-family count must not increase.",
    "Split three receiver source IDs into one shared family; the family count remains one.",
    "Change PNT/time qualification from true to false; the affected track cannot remain qualified.",
    "Change EO/IR environment qualification from true to false; that cell becomes not-qualified.",
    "Permute claims and observations while preserving IDs and meanings; semantic results must remain identical.",
    "Remove all cooperative observations while preserving qualified coverage; the outcome remains NO_OBSERVATION with unresolved possible occupancy.",
    "Change an otherwise qualified claim to upstream-degraded; it must no longer contribute to independent full-coverage count."
  ]
}
